CHAPTER.VERS:
Take with you

          {+}
         words, and return to Yahweh: say to him, Take away all iniquity, and accept that which is good: so we will render [as] bullocks [the offering of] our lips.

Assyria will not save us; we will not ride on horses; neither will we say anymore to the work of our hands, [You

          {+}
         are] our gods; for in you the fatherless finds mercy.
